            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102701,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-11"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "沙绪",
                "textRight": "与PROMISED BLOOD和联盟联合没有异议吧？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "eyeClose": 1,
                        "id": 102501,
                        "lipSynch": 0,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-12"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "…………"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_050.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102701,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-13"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "沙绪",
                "textRight": "静香？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "eyeClose": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_001.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102501,
                        "lipSynch": 1,
                        "motion": 100,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-14"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "嗯，没关系，我没有异议"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102601,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-15"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "千春",
                "textRight": "奇怪的停顿很让人在意耶@小静香真的接受了吗？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102501,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-16"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "我只是回想起了@之前我在时女村落得出的答案"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102601,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-17"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "千春",
                "textRight": "那是指，除了我们以外的人@都只是把巫当作人生的添头吗？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102501,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-18"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "嗯"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102701,
                        "motion": 300,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-19"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "沙绪",
                "textRight": "如果你要这么想，@我们就没法跟任何人联手了哦"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102501,
                        "motion": 300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-20"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "所以，我才决定@将它放在自己心中"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102501,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-21"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "毕竟包括分家的孩子们在内@本家的境遇也是最奇怪的嘛"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102701,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-22"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "沙绪",
                "textRight": "虽然我这么说@或许会让你感到迷茫"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102701,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-23"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "沙绪",
                "textRight": "但即便如此，我也认为@我们应该重视时女一族的矜持"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102501,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "pos": 0,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-24"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "当然了，我完全没有@要改变至今为止的想法的意思"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_001.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102501,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-25"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "作为巫生活在日出之国的土地上@为了人们而鞠躬尽瘁"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102501,
                        "motion": 200,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-26"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "我只是想说，不用强求@一族以外的人也秉持这种理念"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102601,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-27"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "千春",
                "textRight": "毕竟，尽管其他的团体里@有很多因为成为了巫而后悔的人"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102601,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-28"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "千春",
                "textRight": "但即便如此，她们也在为了@帮助城市里的人们而打倒魔女嘛"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102501,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "pos": 0,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-29"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "是啊，如果就算根底不同@我们在做的事也是一样的话"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 102501,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-30"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "静香",
                "textLeft": "不去深究理念的细节@对于得到和平也是有帮助的"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 102701,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102922/vo_full_102904-1-31"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "沙绪",
                "textRight": "那么"
            },
